  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<color=#D29000><font-weight=600>ABOUT THE POLEA DESAI DOOR</font-weight></color>

    Origin:
    Navsari, Gujarat


    <font-weight=600>This heavy wooden door was originally
    part of a larger official<br>gateway (pol) guarding Desaivad</font-weight>- the
    historic residential quarter of Navsari''s influential Desai family.


    In
    traditional Gujarati urban architecture, a pol served as a gated<br>neighborhood
    designed for security, privacy, and community living. As prominent civic administrators
    and tax revenue officers (Desais), the

    family held significant influence
    in shaping Navsari.


    <color=#D29000><font-weight=600>ABOUT THE EXHIBIT:
    THE PROCESS</color></font-weight>


    To design the interactive exhibit for
    the historic Polea Desai Gate, <font-weight=600>Much Ado About Museums began
    with cross-generational interviews with members of the Zoroastrian community,
    from local Dastoors to past residents.</font-weight>


    Guided by the question,
    <font-weight=600>"What was your fondest memory of Navsari?",</font-weight><br>we
    <font-weight=600>collected personal stories and memories tied directly to life
    within<br>the pols.</font-weight> These oral accounts formed the foundation of
    the exhibit''s<br>narrative. By anchoring these personal stories the exhibit
    presents<br>heritage through lived experiences.


    <font-weight=600>Designed
    to evoke a deep sense of homecoming for the Parsi<br>community while offering
    outside visitors an intimate introduction to<br>Navsari''s living culture</font-weight>,
    the interactive experience invites audiences to<br>step through the threshold,
    rediscover the vibrant spirit of the pols, and<br>engage with the memories that
    continue to shape identity.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 95ab5897e14641a4e8c51b81155ab937, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: -3447000513396954358, guid: 95ab5897e14641a4e8c51b81155ab937, type: 2}
